# ============================================================
#  CTF writeup repository — keep writeups, solve scripts and
#  small evidence.  Original challenge distributables, extracted
#  working trees and large binaries are intentionally excluded
#  (GitHub 100 MB/file limit; these are reproducible from the
#  original challenge sources).
# ============================================================

# ── Local secrets / editor / MCP config ──
.mcp.json
.vscode/
.env
*.key
*-key.txt
*.pem

# ── Original challenge material & working trees ──
**/files/
**/_work/
**/extract/
**/extracted/
**/unpacked/
**/Crashpad/
**/_dbg/
**/raw/

# ── Nested upstream tool (available from its own repo) ──
KaliCTF2026/skyline-parser/

# ── Archives & disk / memory images ──
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.tgz
*.gz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.7z
*.rar
*.iso
*.vmdk
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.img
*.dd
*.raw
*.dmp
*.mem

# ── Captures, media, model weights ──
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi

# ── Binaries / libraries ──
*.exe
*.dll
*.pyd
*.so
*.so.*
*.deb
*.flp
*.bin

# ── Wordlists ──
rockyou.txt

# ── Tooling cruft ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Disposable scratch / working dirs (solve experiments, downloaded object stores) ──
**/ctf-scratch/
**/_scratch/
**/scratch/
